                "text": "It\u2019s day 17 of the government shutdown. Here\u2019s where things stand:\n\nHealthcare costs are about to skyrocket for more than 20 million Americans.\n\nRepublicans shut down the government rather than work with Democrats to protect coverage.\n\nI\u2019m holding the line for your healthcare.",
