                "text": "Over 20 million Americans on the ACA marketplace are about to see how their health insurance is going to spike\u2014but it doesn\u2019t have to be this way. Republicans have the power to reopen the government and protect healthcare. They just need to remember who they are supposed to serve: the people.\n\nhttps://t.co/3VK3XPp4V1",
