                "reply_count": 798,
                "retweet_count": 525,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I didn\u2019t spend 20 years saving lives to sit back in Congress while Republicans decimate our healthcare system. The deal being negotiated in the Senate to reopen the government does nothing to lower healthcare costs for a single Oregonian. \n\nTaking Republicans at their word that they\u2019ll\naddress healthcare costs later isn\u2019t compromise\u2014it\u2019s a betrayal of the values Oregonians sent me to Congress to fight for.",
